l14: $ G ⇒ ra_lseqv ⟨ kc_lnil , ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_lnil , ∅ ⟩ ∈ latoms $ by g1_ra_lseqv [l13, l13]
l15: $ G ⇒ ra_lseqv ⟨ kc_lnil , ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_lnil , ∅ ⟩ ∈ lrel2 $ by g1_horn [l7, l8, l14, l9]

