l11: $ G , y = A1 , z = A2 , u = A3 , v = A4 , x = ⟨ scons (ra_lseqv u v) ∅ , ra_lseqv ⟨ kc_lcons , scons y (scons u ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_lcons , scons z (scons v ∅) ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ x = ⟨ scons (ra_lseqv u v) ∅ , ra_lseqv ⟨ kc_lcons , scons y (scons u ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_lcons , scons z (scons v ∅) ⟩ ⟩ ∧ lveq y z $ by and_intro [l9, l10]
l12: $ G , y = A1 , z = A2 , u = A3 , v = A4 , x = ⟨ scons (ra_lseqv u v) ∅ , ra_lseqv ⟨ kc_lcons , scons y (scons u ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_lcons , scons z (scons v ∅) ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ∃ v (x = ⟨ scons (ra_lseqv u v) ∅ , ra_lseqv ⟨ kc_lcons , scons y (scons u ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_lcons , scons z (scons v ∅) ⟩ ⟩ ∧ lveq y z) $ by ex_intro [l11]
l13: $ G , y = A1 , z = A2 , u = A3 , v = A4 , x = ⟨ scons (ra_lseqv u v) ∅ , ra_lseqv ⟨ kc_lcons , scons y (scons u ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_lcons , scons z (scons v ∅) ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ∃ u ∃ v (x = ⟨ scons (ra_lseqv u v) ∅ , ra_lseqv ⟨ kc_lcons , scons y (scons u ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_lcons , scons z (scons v ∅) ⟩ ⟩ ∧ lveq y z) $ by ex_intro [l12]
l14: $ G , y = A1 , z = A2 , u = A3 , v = A4 , x = ⟨ scons (ra_lseqv u v) ∅ , ra_lseqv ⟨ kc_lcons , scons y (scons u ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_lcons , scons z (scons v ∅) ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ∃ z ∃ u ∃ v (x = ⟨ scons (ra_lseqv u v) ∅ , ra_lseqv ⟨ kc_lcons , scons y (scons u ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_lcons , scons z (scons v ∅) ⟩ ⟩ ∧ lveq y z) $ by ex_intro [l13]
