----
l1: $ G , x ∊ cl_eeqv_quot_ind ⇒ x ∊ cl_eeqv_quot_ind $ by ax
l2: $ G , x ∊ cl_eeqv_quot_ind ⇒ ∃ y ∃ z (x = ⟨ ∅ , ra_eeqv ⟨ kc_quot_ind , scons y ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_quot_ind , scons z ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ lveq y z) $ by cab_elim [l1]
