l4: $ G , x = ⟨ ∅ , ra_eeqv ⟨ kc_quot_ind , scons y ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_quot_ind , scons z ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ lveq y z ⇒ x = ⟨ ∅ , ra_eeqv ⟨ kc_quot_ind , scons y ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_quot_ind , scons z ∅ ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_l [l3]
l5: $ G , x = ⟨ ∅ , ra_eeqv ⟨ kc_quot_ind , scons y ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_quot_ind , scons z ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ lveq y z ⇒ kr_eeqv ∈ ω $ by kr_eeqv_omega
l6: $ G , x = ⟨ ∅ , ra_eeqv ⟨ kc_quot_ind , scons y ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_quot_ind , scons z ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ lveq y z ⇒ x ∊ g2_lab kr_eeqv (suc kr_eeqv) $ by g2_lab_self [l4, l5]
